From 9c2d4207c06853d616d592f45f5d10bfa167dbcc Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: bateske <kevin@bateske.com>
Date: Sat, 3 Oct 2026 09:19:53 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 2/3] CHSd P1: fat::stream(), a file's block range through its
 runs

One sd::stream() per run the range touches (lifted from CHStlView's
card::stream()), the range checked against the file before anything is
read. Its own file, FatStream.cpp, so no image that does not call it
grows. Host tests stream every file of every test image: whole files,
every run boundary, random ranges, past the end, a card failing part way.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
